le_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410642004":{"text":"なぜ織り葉は、私たちをこの岩に導いたのだ？","source_cn":"为什么织叶会指引我们观察一块岩石？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B7A6261BFC7CAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410642005:0":{"text":"うーん、言われてみれば確かに、何かに似ているような……なんだろうな？","source_cn":"你这么一说……确实看着是像什么东西，嗯……到底是像什么呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC6A1A6B944D99E3A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"うーん、言われてみれば確かに、何かに似ているような……なんだろうな？","female":"うーん、言われてみれば確かに、何かに似ているような……なんだろうな？","variant_male_record_index":"163338","variant_female_record_index":"163339","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410642006:0":{"text":"巨大な爪……？","source_cn":"像是巨大的利爪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA989902B0E29758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410642007:1":{"text":"え？つ、爪って……まさか、この岩は――","source_cn":"爪、爪子……你是说……这些石头是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1936D344399B2D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1410642007":{"text":"え？つ、爪って……まさか、この岩は――","source_cn":"爪、爪子……你是说……这些石头是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1936D344399B2D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410642008:0":{"text":"これが竜の爪だって！？この黒っぽい岩が！？","source_cn":"——这是龙爪？！就这个黑黢黢的东西？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD38942CF8EBD9DDA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"これが竜の爪だって！？この黒っぽい岩が！？","female":"これが竜の爪だって！？この黒っぽい岩が！？","variant_male_record_index":"163342","variant_female_record_index":"163343","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410642009:0":{"text":"そうか……思い出した！ああ、ヘクト様……竜はずっと、オレらの目の前にいたんだ！","source_cn":"等等……我……我想起来了！赫托啊……龙一直就在我们眼前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DA3AADCB2165F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410642010:0":{"text":"歴史書にも「原初の竜、その姿は山の如く、体は丘の如し、翼は星々を覆い、偉大なる力は見る者を驚嘆させる」って書いてあった。","source_cn":"史书上说过……“初始之龙，其形若山，其体如丘，展翅可遮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7CEE30681E07B0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410642011:0":{"text":"原初の竜は、山のようにデカい！何で今まで気づかなかったんだ！","source_cn":"——初始之龙的身体像山一样庞大！我怎么没想到呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D01B37D771F71B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410642012:1":{"text":"これほど巨大な生物を縛り付けるとは……なんて恐ろしい魔法だ。","source_cn":"能将如此巨大的生物束缚在这里……好可怕的魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F1AC2952A09BCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410642013:0":{"text":"このような複雑な術式を使えるエクシルはそうそういない……","source_cn":"整个萨洛克兰，能使用如此复杂术式的艾塞勒并不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52810361749F689E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1410642013":{"text":"このような複雑な術式を使えるエクシルはそうそういない……","source_cn":"整个萨洛克兰，能使用如此复杂术式的艾塞勒并不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52810361749F689E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410642014:0":{"text":"……女王陛下ご本人だろうな。","source_cn":"……只可能是女王亲手所为。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C19C85916A8937","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……女王陛下ご本人だろうな。","female":"……女王陛下ご本人だろうな。","variant_male_record_index":"163349","variant_female_record_index":"163350","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410642015:0":{"text":"マーリン、この束縛魔法を解除できるか？","source_cn":"梅林，你能解开这个束缚魔法吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65FC864E1D21E7AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マーリン、この束縛魔法を解除できるか？","female":"マーリン、この束縛魔法を解除できるか？","variant_male_record_index":"163351","variant_female_record_index":"163352","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1410642015":{"text":"マーリン、この束縛魔法を解除できるか？","source_cn":"梅林，你能解开这个束缚魔法吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65FC864E1D21E7AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マーリン、この束縛魔法を解除できるか？","female":"マーリン、この束縛魔法を解除できるか？","variant_male_record_index":"163351","variant_female_record_index":"163352","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410642016:0":{"text":"お、おい！原初の竜の封印を解くんだぞ……どうなるか分かってるんだろうな？","source_cn":"你们想好了吗？解开初始之龙的束缚……你们想过后果吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8D229EB6C8E0C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410642017:0":{"text":"怖じ気づいたか？","source_cn":"怕了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5BB5ACF0D249F91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410642018:0":{"text":"んなバカな！むしろ興奮して跳び上がりたいぐらいだ！","source_cn":"哈！你别小瞧我！我现在兴奋得快要燃烧了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CBC9DB1B086C447","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410642019:0":{"text":"陛下は最初から原初の竜の存在を知っていた……ここに竜を縛り付け、卵から霊水を抽出し続けていたのも……","source_cn":"女王早知道初始之龙的存在，甚至将它束缚于此，只为了龙蛋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76FEFFB1C341A7ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410642020:0":{"text":"おいおい、さすがに買いかぶりすぎだ。ヘクト様と並ぶ存在だった竜を、女王様の魔法なんかで抑えつけられるわけないだろ？","source_cn":"哎哎哎……你太抬举你们的女王了。初始之龙可是与赫托老爹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA62546889B94D6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410642021:0":{"text":"なら誰が？お前こそ、陛下の魔法を見くびるな。","source_cn":"不然呢？你不该轻视女王拥有的魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B7B998DE9B7B045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410642022:0":{"text":"エクシルごときに――","source_cn":"区区艾塞勒——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA72DCF354291E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1410642022":{"text":"エクシルごときに――","source_cn":"区区艾塞勒——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA72DCF354291E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410642023:0":{"text":"……マーリンの言うとおりだ。今言い争っても意味はない。","source_cn":"……梅林是对的，现在争论这些没有意义。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5DDFE5ECC1118416","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……マーリンの言うとおりだ。今言い争っても意味はない。","female":"……マーリンの言うとおりだ。今言い争っても意味はない。","variant_male_record_index":"163360","variant_female_record_index":"163361","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410642024:0":{"text":"だな。束縛を解いて、直接竜の口から真相を聞こうじゃないの！","source_cn":"解开束缚！让初始之龙亲口告诉我们真相！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1AB15074EEB0247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_t